<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 10.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali gives instructions that Tunisia should support United Nations efforts for peace in the world.</p>
<p>- President to visit Germany on Wednesday at invitation of President Roman Herzog.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia supports efforts aiming at establishing peace process.</p>
</text>
